# ============================================================
#  private-folder — contents are PRIVATE
#
#  The folder structure below is committed to the public repo so
#  the layout is visible, but every file inside it is ignored.
#  Nothing you drop in here will ever be pushed to GitHub.
#
#  Rule order matters: the last matching pattern wins, so we
#  ignore everything first, then re-allow the structure.
# ============================================================

# 1. Ignore everything in this folder
*

# 2. ...except this .gitignore file itself
!.gitignore

# 3. ...except the subdirectories (skills / tools / references)
!*/

# 4. ...except the .gitkeep placeholders that hold the empty dirs in git
!.gitkeep
